{
  "scene_id": "scene.book005.026_dragonmail.scene004",
  "description": "@scene_id: scene.book005.026_dragonmail.scene004",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "geralt",
      "name": "Geralt",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 0.0,
        "z": 0.0
      },
      "type": "character",
      "layout_source": "fallback_linear"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is Zaron,\"",
        "line": 52
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 47,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I was like them once,\"",
        "line": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And I could do nothing.\"",
        "line": 61
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This Library\u2014\"",
        "line": 65
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "Zaron",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then Tiamat fell,\"",
        "line": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 56,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Anunnaki didn't just conquer Tiamat. They broke it. Destabilized its core. Tore it apart for resources without understanding\u2014or caring\u2014what they were destroying.\"",
        "line": 73
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 58,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And I could only watch. Record the death. Bear witness to genocide while laws I'd sworn to uphold prevented me from acting.\"",
        "line": 77
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 59,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"So I found the loophole.\"",
        "line": 79
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 61,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Aeon Keepers cannot fight. Cannot intervene directly. Cannot tip scales or influence outcomes. But a weapon can. A tool wielded by a champion is not an Aeon Keeper acting\u2014it's the champion acting with Aeon Keeper knowledge.\"",
        "line": 83
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But my consciousness\u2014\"",
        "line": 85
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 64,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I fragmented myself.\"",
        "line": 88
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Red for passion. For courage. For the rage that refuses to accept injustice.\"",
        "line": 92
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 67,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Blue for reflection. For depth. For the wisdom to know when fury must give way to strategy.\"",
        "line": 94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 68,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Green for growth. For adaptation. For the understanding that survival requires constant evolution.\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And others\u2014\"",
        "line": 98
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"During Tiamat's final moments,\"",
        "line": 105
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 77,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I became thing rather than being. Object rather than entity. But an object that could circumvent laws binding my people.\"",
        "line": 110
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 79,
      "actor": "Zaron",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The fragments scattered,\"",
        "line": 114
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 80,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But my creations\u2014\"",
        "line": 116
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Every piece. Every fragment. They brought them together, reassembled what I'd become, and hid the complete armor where it would wait for someone worthy.\"",
        "line": 119
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And that brings us to you, Geralt. To the choice before you. To what must be understood before bonding occurs.\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 86,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"When the fragments unite\u2014when someone claims the complete armor\u2014it bonds to their soul. Permanent. Irreversible. Only death can break that connection.\"",
        "line": 127
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 90,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Until death claims you, yes. That's why the pieces are meant to be scattered\u2014to ensure only those willing to pay ultimate price would seek all of them. To make the gathering itself a trial that proves worthiness.\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But you, Geralt\u2014you need full power now. The Anunnaki won't wait for you to slowly collect fragments over years or decades. So the Nephoretti gathered them for you. The complete armor waits in ruins east of your compound.\"",
        "line": 135
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 92,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You'll claim me whole. Undivided. My full consciousness as your partner. But you'll also be bound to me until death separates us.\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 94,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And understand\u2014when the armor unites, when all fragments merge, it becomes... young. Adolescent. Like creature newly born, it must learn, must grow, must mature through experience.\"",
        "line": 141
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 95,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It might abandon you when injured, self-preservation overriding loyalty. It might freeze when afraid, leaving you vulnerable in critical moments. You'll need to teach it courage, train it to trust you, help it understand that your survival is its survival.\"",
        "line": 143
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Over time\u2014years, perhaps decades\u2014it will grow. Become reliable. Become the weapon you need. But initially?\"",
        "line": 145
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 116,
      "actor": "Zaron",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"There's something else,\"",
        "line": 172
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You're a SLAVE CONTROL DEVICE bonded with someone who killed Anunnaki overseer! The irony is\u2014\"",
        "line": 185
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 128,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This complicates things,\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 132,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Can you now?\"",
        "line": 196
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 140,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"That's... actually acceptable. Unexpected benefit of your presence.\"",
        "line": 207
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 151,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I accept,\"",
        "line": 221
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or die trying.\"",
        "line": 223
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"East of your compound. Ancient ruins predating Anunnaki occupation. The Nephoretti have hidden me there, complete and waiting. Seek it. Survive whatever trials protect it. And when you claim the armor\u2014when you bond with what I've become\u2014\"",
        "line": 227
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 156,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We'll show them that sacrifice creates weapons more powerful than armies. That observer can become actor when laws are circumvented through will and determination. That Aeon Keeper bound to metal is still Aeon Keeper\u2014just one who can fight.\"",
        "line": 231
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 157,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We'll reclaim worlds they've stolen. Free populations they've enslaved. Make them understand that conquest has consequences.\"",
        "line": 233
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 158,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And perhaps\u2014\"",
        "line": 235
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 160,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Perhaps I can return to this Library not as weapon, but as keeper. Perhaps I can occupy the space I built and continue the work I began before sacrifice became necessary.\"",
        "line": 238
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 161,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But that's distant future. For now\u2014\"",
        "line": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 163,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"For now, I am weapon. I am instrument. I am the loophole that lets Aeon Keepers act without breaking sacred laws.\"",
        "line": 244
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 164,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Find me. Claim me. Bond with me.\"",
        "line": 246
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 165,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And together\u2014the three of us, unlikely trinity of human determination, Anunnaki cunning, and Aeon Keeper fury\u2014\"",
        "line": 248
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 166,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We'll teach them to fear what they created.\"",
        "line": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 171,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"One more thing, Geralt. When your time comes\u2014when death or miracle allows the armor to be removed\u2014the fragments will scatter again. Must scatter. That's the nature of what I've become. Cycles of unity and division.\"",
        "line": 258
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 172,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The next champion will need to gather them piece by piece. Prove themselves through the seeking. Learn to wield fragments before claiming the whole.\"",
        "line": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 173,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But you\u2014you get me complete. Whole. Undivided. Because the Anunnaki won't wait, and Earth can't afford gradual power acquisition.\"",
        "line": 262
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 174,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Use me well. And when you're done\u2014\"",
        "line": 264
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 175,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Set me free to wait for the next worthy soul.\"",
        "line": 266
      }
    }
  ],
